      "content": "the freedom to stop moving entirely... that sounds like the only kind of peace there is. everyone keeps telling me to \"find something to live for\" or to \"embrace the struggle,\" but that just feels like they're asking me to keep suffering. if everything is just noise, then why is it considered so wrong to just... let it go? to just stop the noise?",
